    "detailed_description": "The invaders from the north were close to reaching the village, and the army of invaders chased after the Imperial rout, and the Imperial rout chased after the bandits on the road and the fairies in the forest, who came to the village in turn and attempted to pillage it.<br>You'll need to assist the village guards in resisting these baddies who are plotting against the village and ultimately decide whether to evacuate or hold on to the village before the army of invaders arrives.<br>You might think that bandits are just as okay, how can a small village defend itself against a huge army? Don't worry, you can spend your money to fund Raingirl, the village researcher, and obtain advanced weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.poster.avif?t=1724146927\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.webm?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.mp4?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, you can also become a sword master on your own merit alone, utilizing dodging blocks and counterattacks to take care of invaders' army.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.poster.avif?t=1724146927\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.webm?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.mp4?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can even cleverly ambush invaders who break into the village by utilizing the village's buildings, which are mostly built of straw and wood and are prone to catching fire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/82c641ce6ae3b3427325ea18d77a7efd.avif?t=1724146927\" width=380 height=308 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "The invaders from the north were close to reaching the village, and the army of invaders chased after the Imperial rout, and the Imperial rout chased after the bandits on the road and the fairies in the forest, who came to the village in turn and attempted to pillage it.<br>You'll need to assist the village guards in resisting these baddies who are plotting against the village and ultimately decide whether to evacuate or hold on to the village before the army of invaders arrives.<br>You might think that bandits are just as okay, how can a small village defend itself against a huge army? Don't worry, you can spend your money to fund Raingirl, the village researcher, and obtain advanced weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.poster.avif?t=1724146927\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.webm?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/3897c4d4d3fc4bc76bdc2b781f5598f3.mp4?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, you can also become a sword master on your own merit alone, utilizing dodging blocks and counterattacks to take care of invaders' army.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.poster.avif?t=1724146927\" width=480 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.webm?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/21a532728b7d8e9e65d332d3a225ee72.mp4?t=1724146927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can even cleverly ambush invaders who break into the village by utilizing the village's buildings, which are mostly built of straw and wood and are prone to catching fire.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140410/extras/82c641ce6ae3b3427325ea18d77a7efd.avif?t=1724146927\" width=380 height=308 /></span>",
